# Design references and screenshots dropped at the repo root — mockups, UI shots
# and the requirements PDFs. Kept locally, not carried in the repo.
#
# Every pattern is anchored with a leading "/" so it matches the ROOT ONLY.
# Unanchored (`*.png`) would also ignore frontend/src/assets — the traced body
# maps and every app icon — which is exactly the kind of thing that goes
# unnoticed until a build is missing its images.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.gif
/*.webp
/*.bmp
/*.tif
/*.tiff
/*.ico
/*.avif
/*.heic
/*.svg
/*.pdf
